"┌ help ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ Ctrl-] then a key:                                         │"
"│     n  summon          c  cast                             │"
"│     b  banish          r  recall                           │"
"│     t  timetable       x  close                            │"
"│     j  next            k  previous                         │"
"│     a  needs you       [  scroll                           │"
"│   1-9  slot            m  mouse                            │"
"│     d  detach          q  quit                             │"
"│     ?  help           ^]  send ^]                          │"
"│ Nobody on screen, or a departed one: the keys alone.       │"
"│ Scrolled back: j k a row, b f a screen, g the top, q home. │"
"│ ● busy  ✦ needs you  ✧ asked you  ○ resting  · departed    │"
"│ [close esc]                                                │"
"└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
